  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Put The Hammer Down** (1 review): The reviewer singles out Put The Hammer Down as a highlight of the recording [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Put The Hammer Down**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n- **call for encore**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2007-06-09.oktava.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 29 songs; 140 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]\n- **ween2007-06-09.spc4.flacf**: source not stated; 28 songs; 138 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Brad told a fan at the show he wasn't really a Ween fan; his girlfriend got him to tape it [5]\n- A fan at the show filmed video; photos, gig posters, a ticket stub and videos were shared on a Ween forum [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2007-06-09.oktava.shnf**: taped by BradM; transferred by BradM; source: matched Oktava MC-012 (cardioid,-10dd,90*/30cm,FOB,6'LOC) > Edirol UA-5 (Oade digi-mod,44.1kHz) > optical > Creative Nomad JB3 (WAV) [1]. Also: Brad recorded the show and had it posted the very next night [5]\n- **ween2007-06-09.spc4.flacf**: taped by jahdawg; transferred by jahdawg; source: SP-C4's (NOS/Cardoid) > Canare SQ's > UA-5 > NJB3 (16/44.1kHz) [2]",
